# core/data/talk/grammar/en/depth_secret.tlk - TM2d: the depth 3 reveal (owner: TK; docs/TALK.md 6n; design
# TALK_MULTILEVEL 2.3, 3.3 and 10). A close friend, a partner or family, after a few turns on the same topic,
# tells the player one small thing the player did not know: a like, the fear, the hated food or a problem from
# the safe set (hungry, dirty, bored, sick, wants an item, wants a friend). Said once a talk. Kid-safe by
# construction: no secret is a romance, a body or a harm; a child tells a child's fear, favourite or worry in a
# kid voice (the same facts). A problem is said plainly (tags: nojoke): lonely and wanting a friend are never a
# punchline. The guard `secret=` is set by the generator, which picked the fact.

@rule secret.like guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=like&!kid_speaker act: tell
  "Okay, don't tell anyone. I secretly love {like}."
  "Can you keep a secret? {like:cap}. I'm obsessed."
  "Between us, {like} is my favourite thing. Ever."
  "I never say this out loud, but I adore {like}."
@rule secret.like.kid guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=like&kid_speaker tags: kid act: tell
  "Shh, a secret! I really, really like {like}."
  "Don't tell! {like:cap} is my favourite. Pinky promise."
@rule secret.fear guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=fear&!kid_speaker act: tell
  "Don't laugh, but {fear} terrifies me. For real."
  "Okay, secret. I'm scared of {fear}. Please be nice."
  "I haven't told anyone. {fear:cap} makes me shake."
@rule secret.fear.kid guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=fear&kid_speaker tags: kid act: tell
  "Shh. I'm scared of {fear}. Don't tell, okay?"
@rule secret.hate guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=hate&!kid_speaker act: tell
  "Confession: I can't stand {hate}. I fake it at dinner."
  "Don't tell anyone, but {hate} is awful. I pretend."
@rule secret.hate.kid guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=hate&kid_speaker tags: kid act: tell
  "I don't like {hate}. I hide it under my plate."
@rule secret.problem.hungry guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=problem&prob=hungry tags: nojoke act: tell
  "Can I tell you something? I'm really hungry, and I didn't want to say."
@rule secret.problem.dirty guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=problem&prob=dirty tags: nojoke act: tell
  "Can I tell you something? I need a wash, and I felt shy about it."
@rule secret.problem.bored guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=problem&prob=bored tags: nojoke act: tell
  "Can I tell you something? I've been really bored lately."
@rule secret.problem.sick guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=problem&prob=sick tags: nojoke act: tell
  "Can I tell you something? I don't feel well. I kept quiet."
@rule secret.problem.item guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=problem&prob=wants_item tags: nojoke act: tell
  "Can I tell you something? There's a thing I want, and I can't get it."
@rule secret.problem.friend guard: depth=3&rel=best&secret=problem&prob=wants_friend tags: nojoke act: tell
  "Can I tell you something? I wish I had more friends. That's all."
